WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.020
This girl is Kouyama Mitsuki. 12 years old!

00:00:03.380 --> 00:00:04.850
She's become the singer<i> Full Moon...</i>

00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:06.520
...and has had her first taste of work, but...

00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:09.190
...she keeps worrying about whether or not she seems enough like an adult.

00:00:09.190 --> 00:00:11.070
In the end, she was even scolded!

00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:14.450
But, after talking with the local female high school students...

00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:17.530
...she realized that it was fine to accept the futility in trying to become an adult, so...

00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:19.990
...she managed to complete her job safely.

00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:21.090
Well then...

00:00:21.090 --> 00:00:22.900
I wonder what's going to happen today.

00:00:22.910 --> 00:00:23.500
Huh?

00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:28.820
Do you understand?

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:29.760
Yes.

00:02:07.050 --> 00:02:07.680
Hmm?

00:02:08.300 --> 00:02:08.770
Hmm?

00:02:12.470 --> 00:02:14.550
I wanna go too!

00:02:15.390 --> 00:02:17.960
You have to turn into Mitsuki and watch the house.

00:02:17.960 --> 00:02:21.640
If you don't do that, her grandmother will realize that she went out.

00:02:21.640 --> 00:02:22.320
But...

00:02:22.320 --> 00:02:24.490
...I haven't had to do this before, right?

00:02:24.490 --> 00:02:27.990
There's no way we can use visiting 
Wakaouji-sensei as an excuse today...

00:02:27.990 --> 00:02:31.440
...which means that someone has to take her place.

00:02:32.200 --> 00:02:35.590
We can't do anything if I'm not there to change her into a sixteen year old.

00:02:35.590 --> 00:02:36.750
That leaves you.

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:38.720
There's no one else who can do it.

00:02:38.720 --> 00:02:40.070
But...

00:02:40.790 --> 00:02:42.090
Meroko, I'm begging you.

00:02:42.090 --> 00:02:45.130
Today's a very important recording session for my debut.

00:02:45.550 --> 00:02:46.680
So... okay?

00:02:48.550 --> 00:02:50.100
I understand.

00:02:50.100 --> 00:02:51.160
Really?!

00:02:51.430 --> 00:02:52.580
But you know...

00:02:52.580 --> 00:02:54.600
Every once in a while, you have to watch the house, Mitsuki.

00:02:54.930 --> 00:02:58.990
I want to go out too you know...

00:03:00.230 --> 00:03:01.230
Hey!

00:03:01.230 --> 00:03:02.730
Selfish pigs!

00:03:24.710 --> 00:03:26.050
Is that the studio?

00:03:26.380 --> 00:03:27.170
Wow!

00:03:27.510 --> 00:03:29.590
There's a whole bunch of fans!

00:03:29.590 --> 00:03:30.340
Just...

00:03:30.340 --> 00:03:31.760
...who is it that's coming, I wonder...?

00:03:31.760 --> 00:03:33.760
It doesn't matter who it is, right?

00:03:33.930 --> 00:03:35.020
More importantly...

00:03:35.520 --> 00:03:36.980
Eh! Who is it?!

00:03:36.980 --> 00:03:37.810
Who is it?!

00:03:40.190 --> 00:03:41.230
Wow!

00:03:41.650 --> 00:03:42.690
No way.

00:03:42.690 --> 00:03:44.730
It's the Guitar Boys!

00:03:44.730 --> 00:03:46.530
They're going to record now?!{}

00:03:46.530 --> 00:03:48.110
Amazing!

00:03:48.650 --> 00:03:49.490
Hey, hey.

00:03:49.490 --> 00:03:52.200
Didn't you come here to record, too?

00:03:52.200 --> 00:03:52.620
Eh?

00:03:53.240 --> 00:03:53.990
But... But...{alpha timed because of contiguous but... s}

00:03:53.990 --> 00:03:54.620
But... But...

00:03:55.580 --> 00:03:57.000
Man... Let's go.

00:04:21.270 --> 00:04:22.770
Well then, I'll get on here.

00:04:27.400 --> 00:04:29.240
Hey! Mitsuki!

00:04:29.240 --> 00:04:30.990
Ah. Ooshige-san!{}

00:04:31.740 --> 00:04:32.570
Ah...

00:04:33.530 --> 00:04:34.990
What's wrong?

00:04:35.260 --> 00:04:36.220
Over here!

00:04:36.220 --> 00:04:36.980
Here!

00:04:37.200 --> 00:04:38.510
Hurry up and come here!

00:04:38.510 --> 00:04:39.510
Ah. Okay!

00:04:43.540 --> 00:04:45.040
I don't like this... everyone's looking at me.

00:04:45.040 --> 00:04:48.260
You're a singer... that's how it's going to be. 
Nothing you can really do about it.

00:04:48.260 --> 00:04:49.010
Yeah... {Where the heck did a.f.k get "I guess so" from anyway}

00:04:51.550 --> 00:04:53.200
A talking stuffed animal?

00:05:01.640 --> 00:05:02.100
Well? {How are you? replaced because the timing is too short to read it.}

00:05:02.100 --> 00:05:03.330
Did you get enough sleep last night?

00:05:03.330 --> 00:05:04.670
Yeah. For now...

00:05:04.670 --> 00:05:05.640
Then we're okay.

00:05:06.060 --> 00:05:07.690
Let's work hard today!

00:05:08.110 --> 00:05:08.440
Okay!

00:05:13.660 --> 00:05:14.610
Come on, go in.

00:05:16.740 --> 00:05:18.290
Wow!

00:05:27.340 --> 00:05:29.380
I feel... somewhat overwhelmed.

00:05:31.380 --> 00:05:32.640
Um... excuse me.

00:05:32.640 --> 00:05:33.970
We have a job to do.

00:05:33.970 --> 00:05:35.460
She'll be recording here starting today...

00:05:35.460 --> 00:05:36.440
<i>Full Moon-san.</i>

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:38.520
Ah. I'm Full Moon.

00:05:38.520 --> 00:05:39.970
It's a pleasure to be working with you.

00:05:39.990 --> 00:05:41.190
We're counting on you.

00:05:46.150 --> 00:05:47.610
Be strong. Mitsuki.

00:05:47.900 --> 00:05:48.400
Okay!

00:05:48.670 --> 00:05:49.570
It hurts...

00:05:49.900 --> 00:05:51.070
Are you nervous?

00:05:51.230 --> 00:05:52.900
Ah. Sorry, Takuto.

00:05:52.900 --> 00:05:54.100
Don't worry.

00:05:54.100 --> 00:05:55.680
I'm watching over you.

00:05:55.680 --> 00:05:56.230
Okay.

00:05:57.370 --> 00:05:58.490
Ow. Ow. Ow. Ow. Ow.

00:05:59.160 --> 00:06:00.740
Is she going to be okay?

00:06:01.040 --> 00:06:01.860
<i>Full Moon-san.</i>

00:06:01.860 --> 00:06:03.460
Please come over here.

00:06:03.620 --> 00:06:04.630
Ah. Okay.

00:06:07.000 --> 00:06:08.640
Then... promise me.

00:06:08.640 --> 00:06:10.360
You'll definitely stay here and watch me.

00:06:10.710 --> 00:06:11.630
Sure, sure.

00:06:17.590 --> 00:06:18.090
Ah?

00:06:18.470 --> 00:06:19.100
Hey?

00:06:19.100 --> 00:06:19.930
I'm caught.

00:06:20.350 --> 00:06:22.190
What? It's just you guys.

00:06:22.190 --> 00:06:23.500
You came again?

00:06:23.500 --> 00:06:25.060
If they find you, we don't know you.

00:06:25.230 --> 00:06:26.590
Putting that aside...

00:06:26.590 --> 00:06:29.520
Did you see a girl carrying a stuffed animal cat?

00:06:29.650 --> 00:06:30.440
A cat?

00:06:31.020 --> 00:06:31.690
Yeah.

00:06:31.690 --> 00:06:33.990
The one who just went in that studio.

00:06:34.490 --> 00:06:36.000
<i>Full Moon...</i>

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:36.650
Who's that?

00:06:36.650 --> 00:06:37.780
A new artist.

00:06:38.280 --> 00:06:39.320
Hmm...

00:06:40.490 --> 00:06:41.900
<i>Full Moon,</i> huh?

00:06:45.880 --> 00:06:48.030
It's somewhat... peaceful in here.

00:06:48.030 --> 00:06:49.930
So that unnecessary noise won't be picked up...

00:06:49.930 --> 00:06:52.030
...we went all out in building this room.

00:06:52.030 --> 00:06:53.380
Is that so?

00:06:54.340 --> 00:06:55.320
Regarding the position of the mic...{overlapping issue resolved}

00:06:55.320 --> 00:06:56.680
...is this place okay?

00:06:56.680 --> 00:06:57.180
Ah.

00:06:57.470 --> 00:06:58.760
I-It's fine.

00:06:58.760 --> 00:07:00.150
...I think.

00:07:00.600 --> 00:07:02.600
Then... please wait a bit.

00:07:08.690 --> 00:07:10.150
Ah. Ah. Ahem. Ahem. Ahem.

00:07:10.770 --> 00:07:11.910
Ah. Ah. Ah.

00:07:15.360 --> 00:07:16.960
I'm going to sing in here...

00:07:21.660 --> 00:07:22.780
Takuto...

00:07:22.950 --> 00:07:23.680
Huh?

00:07:24.120 --> 00:07:24.990
Excuse us...

00:07:25.160 --> 00:07:26.450
We need to run a mic check, so...

00:07:26.450 --> 00:07:27.750
...can you say something?

00:07:27.910 --> 00:07:28.460
Ah.

00:07:28.670 --> 00:07:29.370
Um...

00:07:29.370 --> 00:07:29.960
Uwa...

00:07:30.170 --> 00:07:30.840
Uwa...

00:07:31.380 --> 00:07:31.850
Um...

00:07:32.670 --> 00:07:34.690
Um, can you hear me?

00:07:34.690 --> 00:07:36.340
Ah. We can hear you.

00:07:36.340 --> 00:07:37.160
It's okay.

00:07:38.880 --> 00:07:40.860
Ah. Producer Takasu. {producer is an honorific now, what has the world come to}{Maybe it can change it to Producer Takasu?}

00:07:40.860 --> 00:07:41.470
Yo.

00:07:41.850 --> 00:07:42.550
You feeling up to this?

00:07:42.760 --> 00:07:44.020
Yes. Somehow...

00:07:44.350 --> 00:07:45.920
For now... here's <i>Myself</i>... {Myself, but erm, misedit in the original script}{edited back to Myself}

00:07:45.920 --> 00:07:47.340
Try singing it. {edited}

00:07:47.340 --> 00:07:47.730
Okay.

00:07:49.560 --> 00:07:50.960
Then... music please.

00:07:55.480 --> 00:07:55.860
Eh.

00:07:56.610 --> 00:07:58.740
Um... start by putting your headphones on.

00:07:58.880 --> 00:08:00.000
Headphones?{Head-hon?}

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:02.910
You put on your headphones so that you can hear the music.

00:08:02.910 --> 00:08:05.200
Ah. Is that what it is?

00:08:05.330 --> 00:08:07.360
Technology has sure come a long way.

00:08:07.370 --> 00:08:08.010
Huh?

00:08:08.160 --> 00:08:09.440
She's a fun girl, isn't she?

00:08:09.440 --> 00:08:10.790
I'm sorry.

00:08:10.790 --> 00:08:12.570
As an amateur, this is her first time in all of this.

00:08:12.830 --> 00:08:13.290
Well...

00:08:13.290 --> 00:08:14.420
Since she's new at this...

00:08:14.420 --> 00:08:16.210
...we'll take it slowly.

00:08:16.590 --> 00:08:18.010
Thank you very much.

00:08:19.300 --> 00:08:22.340
This is going to take up so much time.

00:08:37.910 --> 00:08:40.070
You're bringing out the loneliness at this part, but...

00:08:40.530 --> 00:08:43.780
...it would be better if you showed the feeling of serenity with which you wrote them.

00:08:43.780 --> 00:08:46.030
Serenity?

00:08:46.030 --> 00:08:46.620
That's right.

00:08:46.930 --> 00:08:49.970
You don't have to sing well... just put your feelings.{put}

00:08:49.970 --> 00:08:51.000
Ah, okay.

00:08:51.540 --> 00:08:53.040
So then... let's try it.

00:09:05.390 --> 00:09:05.890
Ah.

00:09:06.350 --> 00:09:07.470
Kitty-chan!

00:09:11.520 --> 00:09:12.810
Ah. Takuto.

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:14.780
A date, right now?

00:09:14.780 --> 00:09:16.450
Wah! I'll go! I'll go!

00:09:16.760 --> 00:09:18.270
Where are you going to take me?

00:09:18.270 --> 00:09:20.160
Eh?! Really?!

00:09:20.400 --> 00:09:21.490
Geez, Takuto.

00:09:21.490 --> 00:09:23.820
You really like me that much, huh.

00:09:23.820 --> 00:09:24.900
I...

00:09:24.900 --> 00:09:26.600
I also like you, of course.

00:09:26.870 --> 00:09:29.260
Why can't that ever happen every once in a while?

00:09:29.580 --> 00:09:30.040
Huh?

00:09:32.500 --> 00:09:33.400
I should...

00:09:45.470 --> 00:09:46.220
Huh?

00:09:46.390 --> 00:09:47.140
Takuto?

00:09:47.680 --> 00:09:50.050
You still look a little nervous.

00:09:50.600 --> 00:09:52.340
Ah. I'm sorry.

00:09:52.340 --> 00:09:54.630
We've been looking at it for a while here, too.

00:09:54.630 --> 00:09:55.980
How about a break?

00:09:55.980 --> 00:09:56.600
Okay!

00:10:01.530 --> 00:10:03.930
Mitsuki. Is your throat dry?

00:10:03.930 --> 00:10:05.280
Do you want some coffee?

00:10:05.280 --> 00:10:06.510
Ooshige-san.

00:10:06.510 --> 00:10:09.820
Do you know what happened to the stuffed animal cat that was here?

00:10:09.820 --> 00:10:10.790
Stuffed animal?

00:10:10.790 --> 00:10:11.760
Yeah.

00:10:14.910 --> 00:10:16.330
What are you doing?

00:10:16.330 --> 00:10:17.000
Ah.

00:10:17.000 --> 00:10:18.630
The members of Guitar Boys! {last line was too awkward}

00:10:18.880 --> 00:10:20.220
Um... actually...

00:10:21.590 --> 00:10:22.800
You're <i>Full Moon,</i> aren't you?

00:10:22.800 --> 00:10:23.860
How old are you?

00:10:23.860 --> 00:10:25.780
I'm... I'm...

00:10:25.780 --> 00:10:28.090
...looking for a stuffed animal cat...

00:10:28.090 --> 00:10:29.100
Do you know anything about one?

00:10:32.980 --> 00:10:35.000
Ah, now that you mention it... just a moment ago...

00:10:35.000 --> 00:10:37.060
...I saw Nanami-chan carrying something like that.

00:10:37.400 --> 00:10:38.520
Really?

00:10:39.070 --> 00:10:41.100
Where did that girl go?

00:10:41.100 --> 00:10:42.040
Where...?

00:10:42.050 --> 00:10:43.570
She went home already, didn't she?

00:10:43.570 --> 00:10:44.570
Eh?!

00:10:44.990 --> 00:10:47.240
Do you know where she lives at? {}

00:10:47.240 --> 00:10:49.260
I have no clue... about something like that...

00:10:49.260 --> 00:10:50.740
I see...

00:10:58.250 --> 00:10:59.130
Hmm?

00:10:59.790 --> 00:11:01.160
Where is this?

00:11:01.160 --> 00:11:02.500
Ah! Kitty-chan.

00:11:02.500 --> 00:11:03.470
You're awake?

00:11:03.470 --> 00:11:03.960
Wha..?{}

00:11:05.840 --> 00:11:07.380
Won't you talk with me?

00:11:09.550 --> 00:11:11.000
Come on...

00:11:13.180 --> 00:11:14.770
Come on!!!

00:11:15.020 --> 00:11:16.720
Stupid! That hurts!

00:11:17.310 --> 00:11:18.210
He talked!

00:11:18.210 --> 00:11:20.520
Man... spare me already.

00:11:21.150 --> 00:11:21.970
See ya.

00:11:22.940 --> 00:11:23.390
Eh?

00:11:23.950 --> 00:11:24.900
Kitty-chan?

00:11:25.240 --> 00:11:27.080
Where are you? Where'd you go?

00:11:28.450 --> 00:11:29.700
Ah...

00:11:30.470 --> 00:11:32.210
Kitty-chan disappeared.

00:11:38.620 --> 00:11:40.920
Don't do this to me...

00:11:47.510 --> 00:11:48.340
Yay!

00:11:48.340 --> 00:11:50.090
Kitty-chan!

00:11:51.430 --> 00:11:54.140
I can't go back to her at this rate.

00:11:54.140 --> 00:11:54.970
Whee!

00:12:13.410 --> 00:12:17.000
Geez... Takuto, where are you?

00:12:18.130 --> 00:12:19.310
What should I do?

00:12:24.630 --> 00:12:25.100
Ah.

00:12:38.930 --> 00:12:39.750
Huh?

00:12:39.750 --> 00:12:41.480
There isn't any sound coming out...?

00:12:44.610 --> 00:12:46.520
Hmm? She's calling for me.

00:12:46.520 --> 00:12:49.060
Don't just talk to yourself.

00:12:49.060 --> 00:12:50.710
Talk to me!

00:12:50.710 --> 00:12:51.110
Hmph.

00:12:51.490 --> 00:12:52.010
Hmm?

00:12:52.740 --> 00:12:54.840
Say something!

00:12:54.870 --> 00:12:56.240
Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow!

00:12:56.240 --> 00:12:58.040
What are you doing?!

00:12:58.040 --> 00:12:59.940
Ah! You talked!

00:12:59.940 --> 00:13:01.790
You're <i>that</i>  happy when I talk?!

00:13:02.210 --> 00:13:03.480
I'm happy!

00:13:03.480 --> 00:13:04.830
I'm not happy, so...

00:13:04.830 --> 00:13:06.060
...I'm leaving, okay?

00:13:06.060 --> 00:13:07.670
Sorry, but I'm busy.

00:13:07.670 --> 00:13:08.940
I can't let you do that.

00:13:08.940 --> 00:13:10.220
Why not?!

00:13:10.220 --> 00:13:11.260
Kitty-chan is...

00:13:11.260 --> 00:13:13.010
...my friend!

00:13:13.010 --> 00:13:14.840
Don't decide that I'm your friend on your own!

00:13:14.840 --> 00:13:15.640
Ah.

00:13:15.640 --> 00:13:16.850
If you're going to say that...

00:13:17.260 --> 00:13:18.180
...then I'll do this!

00:13:18.180 --> 00:13:18.810
Ow! Ow! Ow!

00:13:18.810 --> 00:13:21.310
I get it! I get it, so stop!

00:13:22.560 --> 00:13:24.000
Let's play together, then.

00:13:24.560 --> 00:13:25.520
Man...

00:13:25.520 --> 00:13:27.770
You're even worse than Meroko.

00:13:29.780 --> 00:13:34.860
When in the kitchen, dealing with oil is always a problem.

00:13:32.200 --> 00:13:34.240
Ah! I'm bored.

00:13:34.510 --> 00:13:35.620
Ah...

00:13:34.860 --> 00:13:36.120
That's right!

00:13:35.620 --> 00:13:38.590
Those two haven't come back yet. {No Takuto-tachi here, damnit}

00:13:38.580 --> 00:13:39.740
Until now...

00:13:41.000 --> 00:13:41.930
For heaven's sake...

00:13:41.930 --> 00:13:44.010
Who left the television on?

00:13:44.010 --> 00:13:45.710
It wasn't me.

00:13:45.920 --> 00:13:46.790
Hold it...

00:13:46.790 --> 00:13:48.990
You won't even let me watch television?

00:13:48.990 --> 00:13:50.330
By the way, Tanaka-san.

00:13:50.330 --> 00:13:52.340
Do you know what Mitsuki is doing?

00:13:52.340 --> 00:13:54.980
Yes. I'll go get her right away.

00:13:54.980 --> 00:13:56.760
I'm not joking!

00:13:59.180 --> 00:14:00.220
That girl...

00:14:00.220 --> 00:14:02.980
...she's had to put up with this kind of life?

00:14:07.520 --> 00:14:08.440
At this rate...

00:14:08.440 --> 00:14:10.150
If I don't find Takuto...

00:14:10.150 --> 00:14:11.420
What's gonna happen?

00:14:23.590 --> 00:14:25.620
This whistle is definitely broken! {Translation: This whistle sucks!}

00:14:25.620 --> 00:14:27.460
I can hear it.

00:14:27.670 --> 00:14:28.380
Takuto!

00:14:28.920 --> 00:14:29.490
Yo.

00:14:29.960 --> 00:14:30.970
Takuto.

00:14:30.970 --> 00:14:32.630
Just... what?!

00:14:32.630 --> 00:14:33.970
Come on, Kitty-chan.

00:14:33.970 --> 00:14:35.880
Don't wander off on your own! {a.f.k untranslated it, so best guesslation}{replaced thanks to convexity}

00:14:40.100 --> 00:14:40.600
Hey.

00:14:40.600 --> 00:14:42.590
Will you give me back that stuffed animal?

00:14:42.590 --> 00:14:43.100
Nope!

00:14:43.100 --> 00:14:44.710
Because it's mine!

00:14:44.710 --> 00:14:45.350
But...

00:14:45.350 --> 00:14:47.410
...it's really mine.

00:14:47.770 --> 00:14:48.680
No it's not!

00:14:48.680 --> 00:14:49.700
It's mine!

00:14:50.360 --> 00:14:51.710
Takuto...

00:14:51.710 --> 00:14:53.440
I don't understand it either.

00:14:54.110 --> 00:14:54.860
Kitty-chan.

00:14:54.860 --> 00:14:56.490
Your name is Takuto?

00:14:56.490 --> 00:14:56.950
Ah.

00:14:57.320 --> 00:14:58.410
Hey, Takuto.

00:14:58.410 --> 00:15:01.200
You're my friend, right?

00:15:02.580 --> 00:15:04.830
You took me away while I was 
sleeping without even asking...

00:15:04.830 --> 00:15:06.940
...friends don't do things like that.

00:15:06.940 --> 00:15:08.490
While you were asleep?

00:15:08.490 --> 00:15:10.380
You're mean, Takuto!

00:15:10.590 --> 00:15:13.130
You said that you'd listen to me, didn't you?

00:15:13.130 --> 00:15:16.170
A-A-At that time, you were still practicing.

00:15:16.610 --> 00:15:19.130
I was totally awake while you were recording.

00:15:19.130 --> 00:15:20.070
Oh, that's right!

00:15:20.070 --> 00:15:21.890
What about your recording?!

00:15:21.890 --> 00:15:22.600
Just now...

00:15:22.600 --> 00:15:25.600
...they called to say they weren't ready yet, so it's fine.

00:15:25.850 --> 00:15:26.600
Wait a second.

00:15:26.600 --> 00:15:30.100
Don't talk to my Takuto so familiarly.

00:15:30.100 --> 00:15:31.650
You know... Nanami-chan.

00:15:32.110 --> 00:15:33.520
Takuto belongs to me.

00:15:34.070 --> 00:15:35.320
Show me proof then.

00:15:35.570 --> 00:15:37.150
I don't have any proof, but...

00:15:37.570 --> 00:15:39.030
...but he's mine.

00:15:39.030 --> 00:15:41.320
You're the singer<i> Full Moon,</i> right?

00:15:41.320 --> 00:15:41.870
Eh?

00:15:41.870 --> 00:15:43.120
Yes, but...

00:15:43.830 --> 00:15:46.430
You should hurry up and go back to the studio, shouldn't you?

00:15:46.660 --> 00:15:47.500
That's why...

00:15:47.500 --> 00:15:50.190
If you don't give me back Takuto, I can't sing!

00:15:50.190 --> 00:15:52.040
That's such a childish thing to say.

00:15:52.040 --> 00:15:53.340
That's because...

00:15:54.090 --> 00:15:55.340
Where are you going?

00:15:55.670 --> 00:15:56.990
Back home.

00:15:58.050 --> 00:15:59.110
That's it!

00:16:01.770 --> 00:16:03.720
This place is my home.

00:16:03.970 --> 00:16:04.310
Eh?

00:16:04.850 --> 00:16:05.350
Come on.

00:16:05.600 --> 00:16:06.980
Let's go in, Takuto.

00:16:08.890 --> 00:16:10.760
Takuto, what do you want to play?

00:16:10.760 --> 00:16:11.650
Nanami-chan.

00:16:11.650 --> 00:16:13.510
Will it be okay if you don't go home?

00:16:13.510 --> 00:16:14.140
It's fine.

00:16:14.440 --> 00:16:17.190
Your father and your mother will be worried.

00:16:17.190 --> 00:16:18.200
They won't be.

00:16:18.200 --> 00:16:19.080
Why?

00:16:19.780 --> 00:16:20.790
Because I don't have any.

00:16:20.790 --> 00:16:21.320
Eh?

00:16:21.820 --> 00:16:22.240
Eh?

00:16:22.910 --> 00:16:23.830
Nanami-chan.

00:16:23.830 --> 00:16:26.120
You don't have a father or mother?

00:16:26.410 --> 00:16:26.740
Yep.

00:16:27.160 --> 00:16:28.920
You're... all alone?

00:16:29.120 --> 00:16:29.540
Yep.

00:16:30.460 --> 00:16:31.250
Nanami-chan...

00:16:39.970 --> 00:16:41.050
Takuto, here we go!

00:16:41.050 --> 00:16:42.180
Yay!

00:16:43.970 --> 00:16:45.050
This is fun!

00:16:45.050 --> 00:16:46.310
Let's go again!

00:17:12.750 --> 00:17:13.680
Here we go!

00:17:14.170 --> 00:17:15.230
Yay!

00:17:19.050 --> 00:17:20.760
Are you having fun, Nanami-chan?

00:17:20.760 --> 00:17:22.130
Yep. I'm having fun.

00:17:22.340 --> 00:17:23.340
I see.

00:17:28.850 --> 00:17:31.270
Nanami-chan, you're lonely, aren't you?

00:17:31.560 --> 00:17:33.040
I'm not lonely at all.

00:17:33.310 --> 00:17:34.040
That's a lie. {Mitsuki's character accusing of someone as a lier? edited}

00:17:35.730 --> 00:17:37.020
Because you're lonely...

00:17:37.020 --> 00:17:38.770
...you took Takuto, didn't you?

00:17:40.160 --> 00:17:42.800
Then... if I say I'm lonely...

00:17:42.800 --> 00:17:44.720
...is it okay if I don't give Takuto back?

00:17:44.910 --> 00:17:45.450
Eh?

00:17:45.450 --> 00:17:46.170
Is...

00:17:46.870 --> 00:17:48.830
Is it okay for me to be with Takuto forever?

00:17:48.830 --> 00:17:50.510
Ah... That's...

00:17:53.710 --> 00:17:54.530
As if.

00:17:55.670 --> 00:17:57.350
Everything I said was a lie.

00:17:57.590 --> 00:17:58.170
Eh?!

00:17:59.000 --> 00:18:01.380
My father and mother are over there.

00:18:01.380 --> 00:18:03.090
What did you just say?!

00:18:04.300 --> 00:18:05.270
Hold it!

00:18:05.280 --> 00:18:06.460
Nanami-chan!

00:18:11.470 --> 00:18:11.980
See.

00:18:11.980 --> 00:18:13.770
There's my father and mother.

00:18:17.530 --> 00:18:19.940
That's a lie too, isn't it?

00:18:19.940 --> 00:18:20.790
It is?

00:18:22.740 --> 00:18:23.080
Ah.

00:18:23.690 --> 00:18:24.760
Nanami-chan.

00:18:25.450 --> 00:18:27.960
Your total comes to 933 yen.

00:18:28.160 --> 00:18:28.690
Hmm?

00:18:29.120 --> 00:18:30.160
A thousand yen, is it?

00:18:30.620 --> 00:18:32.360
I wonder what should I get.

00:18:32.950 --> 00:18:34.460
If you have a mother...

00:18:34.460 --> 00:18:37.120
...then why won't she make dinner for you?

00:18:37.340 --> 00:18:38.770
That's because she's busy.

00:18:39.040 --> 00:18:41.450
Are they really your father and mother?

00:18:41.450 --> 00:18:41.770
Ah.

00:18:41.920 --> 00:18:43.170
I'll get this.

00:18:44.090 --> 00:18:44.930
It's true.

00:18:47.010 --> 00:18:47.640
But...

00:18:47.640 --> 00:18:49.550
When you entered the store...

00:18:49.550 --> 00:18:51.960
...they didn't say anything to you at all, did they?

00:18:51.960 --> 00:18:53.320
That's how it always is.

00:18:53.560 --> 00:18:54.680
Always...?

00:18:55.270 --> 00:18:56.060
Every day.

00:18:56.060 --> 00:18:56.680
Eh?

00:18:56.680 --> 00:18:59.520
You mean that you eat dinner by yourself every day?

00:19:00.270 --> 00:19:01.010
That's right.

00:19:02.610 --> 00:19:03.770
Every day?

00:19:17.250 --> 00:19:18.580
This is too strange.

00:19:20.210 --> 00:19:22.280
If they're your real father and mother...

00:19:22.280 --> 00:19:23.900
...why don't they say anything?

00:19:24.590 --> 00:19:25.320
Why?

00:19:26.050 --> 00:19:27.560
If they were your real family...

00:19:27.570 --> 00:19:28.880
When you go home...

00:19:28.880 --> 00:19:32.140
...you'd say "I'm home", and they'd say "welcome back", right?

00:19:33.180 --> 00:19:34.310
Because I...

00:19:34.310 --> 00:19:36.210
If I had a father and mother...

00:19:36.210 --> 00:19:39.290
I would say "I'm home", and I would want them to say "welcome back" to me!

00:19:40.900 --> 00:19:44.570
And you say that you have parents...

00:19:44.570 --> 00:19:45.660
Why?!

00:19:47.320 --> 00:19:48.220
She...

00:19:58.770 --> 00:19:59.920
Nanami-chan...

00:20:00.420 --> 00:20:02.460
Because I also want...

00:20:03.040 --> 00:20:04.750
...to talk to my father and mother, and...

00:20:05.000 --> 00:20:07.740
...there are lots of things I want to talk about.{}

00:20:09.430 --> 00:20:10.180
But...

00:20:10.180 --> 00:20:12.120
They're always busy, so...

00:20:12.720 --> 00:20:13.470
I...

00:20:14.430 --> 00:20:15.310
I...

00:20:21.690 --> 00:20:22.350
Nanami.

00:20:22.670 --> 00:20:24.070
Mama!

00:20:24.770 --> 00:20:27.150
Mama! Mama!

00:20:27.150 --> 00:20:28.510
I'm sorry, Nanami.

00:20:29.030 --> 00:20:29.950
We couldn't...

00:20:29.950 --> 00:20:32.030
...take proper care of you.

00:20:35.210 --> 00:20:36.410
We're so sorry.

00:20:36.410 --> 00:20:37.520
Please forgive us.

00:20:38.630 --> 00:20:39.500
Nanami...

00:20:39.830 --> 00:20:41.460
Papa!

00:20:43.710 --> 00:20:46.250
Isn't this great, Nanami-chan? {Since a.f.k ommited an honorific in this line, they should have just localized this whole show}

00:20:53.890 --> 00:20:55.430
Onee-chan, here.

00:20:55.430 --> 00:20:58.200
I'm very sorry for taking Takuto without asking.

00:21:00.430 --> 00:21:01.390
My, my.

00:21:01.390 --> 00:21:03.230
I was wondering about what would happen.

00:21:05.400 --> 00:21:06.920
Hey. Nanami-chan.

00:21:07.530 --> 00:21:09.020
Do you want to go to the recording with me?

00:21:09.030 --> 00:21:09.370
Eh?

00:21:09.740 --> 00:21:10.460
This time...

00:21:10.460 --> 00:21:11.970
You won't have to do it secretly.

00:21:13.070 --> 00:21:13.600
Okay!

00:21:18.450 --> 00:21:19.450
She's good, isn't she?

00:21:19.660 --> 00:21:21.520
She's giving off an aura of serenity.

00:21:21.520 --> 00:21:22.040
Yeah.

00:21:23.420 --> 00:21:24.420
By the way, who is she?

00:21:24.790 --> 00:21:27.130
Full Moon's Number One Fan.

00:21:27.130 --> 00:21:27.730
Eh?

00:21:28.090 --> 00:21:29.840
Come on, it's okay, isn't it?

00:23:06.560 --> 00:23:07.440
Costume, check!

00:23:07.440 --> 00:23:08.440
Makeup, check!

00:23:08.440 --> 00:23:09.440
Ah, Takuto!

00:23:09.440 --> 00:23:10.400
What do we do?! What do we do?!

00:23:10.400 --> 00:23:11.900
Will she sing well, I wonder...{changed to "will" instead of "can"}

00:23:11.900 --> 00:23:13.840
What are you so worked up about, Meroko?

00:23:13.840 --> 00:23:15.990
It's not like you're the one who's singing.

00:23:15.990 --> 00:23:17.180
That's true, but...

00:23:17.180 --> 00:23:19.160
Today's her debut, and...

00:23:19.160 --> 00:23:20.620
...I'm worried.

00:23:20.620 --> 00:23:21.120
Well...

00:23:21.120 --> 00:23:22.030
She'll do what she can.

00:23:22.030 --> 00:23:24.140
We can deal with the pain and joy later.

00:23:24.140 --> 00:23:24.780
Wait...

00:23:24.780 --> 00:23:26.910
She's gotten into some kind of trouble again!

00:23:27.250 --> 00:23:29.400
Next time on Full Moon wo Sagashite:

00:23:29.400 --> 00:23:31.000
Full Moon, Debut!
